{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"c:objc(cs)MLNMultiPolygon(cm)multiPolygonWithPolygons:","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:"}],"title":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Type Method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates and returns a multipolygon object consisting of the given polygons."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon\/multiPolygonWithPolygons:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"instancetype"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:Q$objc(cs)NSArray","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray<MLNPolygon *>"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"polygons"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The array of polygons defining the shape."}]}],"name":"polygons"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A new multipolygon object."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolygon\/multipolygonwithpolygons:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon"]]},"sections":[],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNPolygon":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","fragments":[{"text":"MLNPolygon","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object represents a closed shape consisting of four or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices, specified as "},{"code":"CLLocationCoordinate2D","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instances, and the edges that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connect them. For example, you could use a polygon shape to represent a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"building, a lake, or an area you want to highlight."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnpolygon","title":"MLNPolygon"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"MapLibre","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPolygon/multiPolygonWithPolygons:":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolygon\/multipolygonwithpolygons:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates and returns a multipolygon object consisting of the given polygons."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon\/multiPolygonWithPolygons:","title":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"multiPolygonWithPolygons:"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMultiPolygon":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon","fragments":[{"text":"MLNMultiPolygon","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMultiPolygon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object represents a shape consisting of one or more"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"polygons that do not overlap. For example, you could use a multipolygon shape"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to represent the body of land that consists of an island surrounded by an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"atoll: the inner island would be one "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNPolygon","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" object, while the surrounding"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"atoll would be another. You could also use a multipolygon shape to represent a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"group of disconnected but related buildings."}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmultipolygon","title":"MLNMultiPolygon"}}}